    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Container for a collection of <ref refid="structStructure" kindref="compound">Structure(s)</ref>.</para>
<para>Usage example: <verbatim># Default constructor creates an empty StructureDB object.
StructureDB stdb;
# Add structures from the file &quot;db.dat&quot;
stdb.add(&quot;db.dat&quot;);
</verbatim></para>
<para>Usage example: <verbatim># Load all structure files listed in a Config file
Config config(&quot;config&quot;);
StructureDB stdb(config);
</verbatim></para>
<para>Usage example: <verbatim># Print this object summary using streams:
std::cout &lt;&lt; stdb;

# Print 3rd Atom data from the 1st Structure
std::cout &lt;&lt; stdb(0,2);
</verbatim></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structStructure" kindref="compound">Structure</ref> <ref refid="classNNFinder" kindref="compound">NNFinder</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
